<title>UK: London gold fixes easier, PGMs drive firmer.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes easier, PGMs drive firmer.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $342.25 vs $343.00 previously. Bought early with PGMs, some support from dollar but still nervous over European central banks. Seemingly caught in $340-$343 range.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - $2.50 firmer at $396.00/$397.00. No negative</p>
<p>response to confirmation of Russia export plans. PALLADIUM - Up</p>
<p>$2.50 at $180.25/$181.25. Still very tight.</p>
<p>SILVER - Two cents easier at $4.68/$4.70.</p>
</text>
